<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42358" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέω</span></b>  (A), 
			Ep.
		 Verb, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεείνω, ἔρομαι,
				ἐρωτάω</span>
			, <i>ask, inquire,</i> c. acc. rei, <i>about</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέων γενεήν τε τόκον τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.128
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.31
			</span></i> ; <i>seek for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὕλαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1354
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. pers.,
				<i>question,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάντιν ἐρείομεν</span> (v. infr.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢ ἱερῆα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.62
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλους ἐρέοιμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.192
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως ἐρέοιμι ἑκάστην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.229
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. acc. rei,
				<i>search, explore,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλυούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					143
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέθοντες</span>
			). (Prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρε</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ</span>)-, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρευτής</span> : <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρείομεν</span>
			perh. metri gr. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέ</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ</span>) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ο-μεν,</span>
			pres.
			subj. of non-thematic stem.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
